window.CURRENT_TASK={"task_id": "L3-FUC-013-A2", "layer": "L3", "target_id": "FUC-013", "artifact_id": "FUC-013-A2", "title": "FUC-013 Receive Situational Awareness Data / A2", "protocol_version": "L3_PURE_COVERAGE_3.0.0", "artifact_sha256": "e3d111a773e9eb43aa7b6212e873463084c1e10aa1edfbb90b28758232f8b5e1", "source_sha256": "40e0827f373b73731838c63950f540172969d6c83af6ebea4de3c9f3f5722e99", "reference_sha256": "89457bb357bac7e06830ad6e173aeb31fb140f4fb6b757f081d142189223d970", "reference_origin": "agent_reference_reused", "instructions": "<pre>本包明确复用冻结的 Agent 来源参照，属于人工覆盖复评，不构成“真人独立建立参照”。不展示任何候选评分。FULL为全部实质含义覆盖；PARTIAL不折半分；NOT_COVERED未覆盖；CONTRADICTED矛盾；UNRESOLVED未决。来源未决统一保留在分母，不能猜成已确认；技术失败另列且留在分母。允许七槽联合表达。</pre>", "material_html": "<h3>Receive Situational Awareness Data</h3><p>给定参与者：Non-C2 JU</p><div class=\"source\"><p>许可来源：milstd6016b_sec4</p><a href=\"assets/40e0827f373b73731838c63950f540172969d6c83af6ebea4de3c9f3f5722e99.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">打开完整来源 PDF（含原页图像）</a> · <a href=\"assets/40e0827f373b73731838c63950f540172969d6c83af6ebea4de3c9f3f5722e99.txt\" target=\"_blank\">同版全文文本</a></div><h3>冻结共同参照：已有 Agent 来源参照，非人工金标准</h3><pre>{&#x27;goal&#x27;: &#x27;Define requirements for a Non-C2 JU receiving surveillance situational awareness data over the Link 16 Surveillance NPG, including processing of track management, alerts, IFF/SIF, and exercise data.&#x27;, &#x27;actor&#x27;: &#x27;Non-C2 JU&#x27;, &#x27;start_boundary&#x27;: &#x27;Monitoring the Surveillance NPG to receive J3-series remote surveillance track and point data.&#x27;, &#x27;success_boundary&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU receives and processes situational awareness, early warning, drop-track, alert, and IFF/SIF data needed for its platform mission, without transmitting on the Surveillance NPG (except where explicitly permitted by Information Management rules).&#x27;, &#x27;in_scope&#x27;: [&#x27;Reception of J3 Surveillance messages (Air, Surface, Subsurface, Land, Space, EW, Reference Points).&#x27;, &#x27;Prohibition of transmission on Surveillance NPG.&#x27;, &#x27;Processing of Drop Track Reports (J7.0 ACT=0).&#x27;, &#x27;Purging of remote tracks.&#x27;, &#x27;Handling of Force Tell and Emergency alerts (J2, J3, J7.0).&#x27;, &#x27;Handling of Exercise Status Orders (J7.0 ACT=6) and Exercise Indicators.&#x27;, &#x27;IFF/SIF data monitoring, difference reporting (J7.5), and update requests.&#x27;, &#x27;Filtering rules (Receive filters, override by alerts).&#x27;, &#x27;Identity and Environment/Category difference resolution (J7.0 ACT=1, ACT=2).&#x27;, &#x27;Strength changes (J7.0 ACT=5).&#x27;, &#x27;Track Identifier management (J7.4).&#x27;, &#x27;Association data purging (J7.7).&#x27;], &#x27;out_of_scope&#x27;: [&#x27;C2 JU transmission of J3 surveillance messages.&#x27;, &#x27;C2 JU reporting responsibility and common tracking procedures (correlation/decorrelation).&#x27;, &#x27;Needline PG specific variance reporting (J12.6) unless explicitly tied to general SA reception.&#x27;, &#x27;Electronic warfare, ballistic missile covariance, IFF management, filter management, or other C2-specific procedures not applicable to Non-C2 reception.&#x27;], &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 1, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;NonC2 JUs shall receive situational awareness information from the Surveillance NPG including track and Reference Point data necessary to support the platform mission. NonC2 JUs shall not transmit on the Surveillance NPG.&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 87, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;To support their missions, nonC2 JUs shall monitor the Surveillance NPG; however, they are prohibited from transmitting on this NPG.&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 88, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;NonC2 JUs shall process J7.0 messages with the Track Management Action field set to value 0, Drop Track Report, for locally held remote tracks.&#x27;}]}</pre><h3>交互目标 / goal</h3><pre>[goal:0 / CL-9969c363a36fb431] Provide requested surveillance information to the controlling JU.</pre><h3>前置条件 / preconditions</h3><p>［空槽］</p><h3>触发条件 / trigger</h3><pre>[trigger:0 / CL-fcff97dd97985fc9] The Non-C2 JU receives a J7.0 (ACT = 1) Data Update Request Initial Word from a Controlling Unit.</pre><h3>主流程 / main_flow</h3><pre>[main_flow:0 / CL-f06525e714fc05da / step 1] The Non-C2 JU receives a J7.0 (ACT = 1) Data Update Request Initial Word.</pre><pre>[main_flow:1 / CL-f07035890b1c12c0 / step 2] The Non-C2 JU sends a J7.1 (ACT = 1) message containing its own Track Number and appropriate JU Platform and System Status messages.</pre><pre>[main_flow:2 / CL-e14a975378e4f7f1 / step 3] If the Controlling Unit requests specific track data by setting the Action, Data Update Request field to value 0, 5, or 6, the Non-C2 JU responds with the requested surveillance information in a J3.4 message.</pre><pre>[main_flow:3 / CL-0971fe60efd566c3 / step 4] If the Controlling Unit requests that the Non-C2 JU respond to all subsequent J3.4 messages it transmits, the Non-C2 JU shall transmit all future J3.4 messages to that Controlling Unit.</pre><h3>备选流程 / alternative_flow</h3><p>［空槽］</p><h3>异常流程 / exception_flow</h3><p>［空槽］</p><h3>后置条件 / postconditions</h3><pre>[postconditions:0 / CL-d279f40e7032e6ef] The Non-C2 JU has successfully transmitted its own Track Number and appropriate JU Platform and System Status messages to the Controlling Unit.</pre><pre>[postconditions:1 / CL-81ba83f44ff5df30] If the Action field in the request indicated a specific data query (values 0, 5, or 6), the Non-C2 JU has transmitted the corresponding surveillance information in a J3.4 message.</pre><pre>[postconditions:2 / CL-6dbf7b30d9107d78] If the Action field in the request indicated a subscription to all future data (value 1), the Non-C2 JU is now transmitting all subsequent J3.4 messages to the requesting Controlling Unit.</pre>", "groups": [{"key": "coverage", "title": "逐需求覆盖", "fields": [{"key": "label", "label": "覆盖标签", "type": "select", "required": true, "options": ["FULL", "PARTIAL", "NOT_COVERED", "CONTRADICTED", "UNRESOLVED", "TECHNICAL_FAILURE"]}, {"key": "location", "label": "输出位置/断言 ID/原文；无匹配填无", "type": "textarea", "required": true}, {"key": "reason", "label": "判定理由（列出遗漏的条件、否定、顺序或结果）", "type": "textarea", "required": true}], "rows": [{"title": "S16-07-R0001", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A Non-C2 JU shall receive situational awareness information from the Surveillance NPG, including track and Reference Point data necessary to support the platform mission.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 1, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;NonC2 JUs shall receive situational awareness information from the Surveillance NPG including track and Reference Point data necessary to support the platform mission.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0002", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A Non-C2 JU shall monitor the Surveillance NPG to support its mission.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 87, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;To support their missions, nonC2 JUs shall monitor the Surveillance NPG; however, they are prohibited from transmitting on this NPG.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0003", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A Non-C2 JU shall not transmit on the Surveillance NPG.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 1, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;NonC2 JUs shall not transmit on the Surveillance NPG.&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 87, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;they are prohibited from transmitting on this NPG.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0004", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A Non-C2 JU shall use remote surveillance track and point data available in J3-series messages for situational awareness and early warning information.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 87, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Remote surveillance track and point data available in the J3 series messages shall provide nonC2 JUs situational awareness and early warning information.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0005", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A Non-C2 JU shall monitor J3.2 Air Track, J3.3 Surface (Maritime) Track, and J3.5 (PTI = 1) Land (Ground) Track messages for situational awareness and early warning information.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 23, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The specific messages used to report Air, Surface (Maritime), and Land (Ground) surveillance data are the J3.2, J3.3, and J3.5 (PTI = 1) messages, respectively. These messages are monitored by nonC2 JUs, such as fighter aircraft, for situational awareness and early warning information.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0006", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A Non-C2 JU shall process a received J7.0 message with the Track Management Action field set to value 0, Drop Track Report, for locally held remote tracks.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 88, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;NonC2 JUs shall process J7.0 messages with the Track Management Action field set to value 0, Drop Track Report, for locally held remote tracks.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0007", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A Non-C2 JU may have the capability to automatically purge locally held remote tracks after a system-selected time interval when those tracks are no longer being updated.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 88, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Additionally, nonC2 JUs may have the capability to automatically purge locally held remote tracks, after a specified time interval, when these tracks are no longer being updated. The time interval is a system selected parameter.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0008", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A receiving Non-C2 JU shall set the FT IND to value 1 in its database for all TNs in a segmented line or multisided area if a J3.0 message with the FT IND field set to value 1 or a J7.0 (ACT = 4) message with the Alert Status Change field set to value 1 is received for any TN in the line or area.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 103, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall set the FT IND to value 1 in their database for all TNs in a segmented line or multisided area if a J3.0 message with the FT IND field set to value 1 or a J7.0 (ACT = 4) message with the Alert Status Change field set to value 1 is received for any TN in the line or area.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0009", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A receiving Non-C2 JU shall terminate the force tell alert on all TNs in a segmented line or multisided area upon receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 4) message clearing the force tell on any TN in the line or area.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 104, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall terminate the force tell alert on all TNs in a segmented line or multisided area on receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 4) message clearing the force tell on any TN in the line or area.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0010", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A receiving Non-C2 JU shall terminate the emergency or force tell alert in its database upon receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 3 or 4) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 105, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall terminate the emergency or force tell alert in their databases upon receipt of the J7.0 (ACT = 3 or 4) message.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0011", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A receiving Non-C2 JU may optionally clear alerts by reception of a J3.X message with the EMG IND and/or FT IND set to value 0.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 104, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Optionally, \\nalerts may be cleared by reception of a J3.X message with the EMG IND and/or \\nFT IND set to value 0.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0012", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not transmit a J7.0 (ACT = 0) message on a purged remote track/point.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When purging a remote track/point&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 10, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The JU shall not transmit a J7.0 (ACT = 0) message on a purged remote track/point.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0013", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall monitor IFF/SIF data reported by the JU with R2.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 47, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;all other JUs without R2 are responsible for monitoring such data&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0014", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall report IFF/SIF data using the J7.5 message only if it holds different data than that reported by the JU with R2.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If holding different IFF/SIF data&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 47, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;only reporting if they hold different data with the J7.5 message.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0015", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall compare locally held IFF/SIF data with data reported by the JU with R2 and report any valid data that are different in accordance with the IFF/SIF Difference Resolution Matrix.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 120, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Each JU without R2 shall compare locally held data with IFF/SIF data reported by the JU with R2 and report any valid data that are different, in accordance with the rules below.&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 121, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;TABLE 4.7-5. IFF/SIF Difference Resolution Matrix&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0016", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall automatically report new IFF/SIF data in a J7.5 (ACT = 1) message when entering a change of nonzero to nonzero or zero to nonzero value to its locally held Mode I, III or IV data, or a change from zero to nonzero Mode II data.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When local IFF/SIF data changes as specified&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 122, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Any JU without R2 entering a change of nonzero to nonzero or zero to nonzero value to its locally held Mode I, III or IV IFF/SIF data, or a change from zero to nonzero Mode II data, shall automatically report the new data in a J7.5 (ACT = 1) message.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0017", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall filter simulated tracks if the option is implemented.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;Optionally&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 9, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;JUs also have the option of filtering simulated tracks.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0018", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall consider data concerning a track with Exercise Indicator set to value 1 as artificial for exercise purposes, except for Track Number, Tracking Data, Simulation Indicator, Environment/Category, and specific Status Data.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When Exercise Indicator is 1&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;For any track with Exercise Indicator set to value 1, Exercise Track, data concerning the track must be considered artificial, for exercise purposes, except that the following shall not be artificial:&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0019", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not filter any track or nonC2 IU with an EMG IND or FT IND set to the value of 1.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When applying filters&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 132, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Any track or nonC2 IU with an EMG IND or FT IND set to the value of 1 shall not be filtered.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0020", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not filter a J3.1 message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When applying filters&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 132, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;A J3.1 message shall not be filtered.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0021", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept all defined field values for Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, and Special Interest Indicator for retransmission and operator appreciation if assuming R2, even if not implemented for transmission origination.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If assuming R2 for a previously-reported track&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 43, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;For each of the Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, and Special \\nInterest Indicator fields which are implemented by a C2 JU, the JU shall \\naccept all defined field values for retransmission and operator appreciation, \\nin the event of assuming R2 for a previously-reported track.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0022", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall discard messages with the Exercise Indicator set to value 1 after receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 6) Exercise Status Order message until local operator action is taken to reenable acceptance.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;After receiving J7.0 ACT=6&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 107, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;After receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 6) message, all subsequent messages \\nreceived with the Exercise Indicator set to value 1 shall be discarded&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0023", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall automatically set the Identity Amplifying Descriptor to Exercise Friend for all tracks with Exercise Indicator set to 1 upon receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 6) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;Upon receipt of J7.0 ACT=6&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 107, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Upon receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 6) message, all JUs shall take the following actions on all tracks in their database which have the Exercise Indicator set to value 1: (1) Automatically set the Identity Amplifying Descriptor to Exercise Friend.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0024", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall automatically set all data fields that may contain artificial information to No Statement, default value, or actual values if held, and set Exercise Indicator to 0 upon receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 6) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;Upon receipt of J7.0 ACT=6&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 107, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;(2) Automatically set all data fields that may contain artificial information ... to the No Statement, default value, or actual values if held in database, and set the Exercise Indicator to value 0.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0025", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall revert the locally held value of a field to No Statement when receiving a Reset to No Statement value for that field.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving Reset to No Statement&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 11, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When a system receives a Reset to No Statement value, it shall automatically revert the locally held value of that field to No Statement.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0026", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall retain the locally held value for a field when receiving a No Statement value for that field, if a value other than No Statement is locally held.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving No Statement and holding non-No Statement&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 11, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When a system receives a No Statement value for a field which has a Reset to No Statement value and for which a value other than No Statement is locally held, the locally held value shall be retained&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0027", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not process the Bearing 2, ASW field upon receipt of a J5.4 message with BRT set to value 0 or 2.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J5.4 with BRT=0 or BRT=2&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 56, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Upon receipt of a BRT set to value 2, JUs shall not process the Bearing 2, ASW field.&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 56, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Upon receipt of a J5.4 message with BRT set to value 0, JUs shall not process the Bearing 2, ASW field.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0028", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall discard a J5.4 message with BRT set to value 0 or 3 if the Range field is received as No Statement.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J5.4 with BRT=0 or 3 and Range=No Statement&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 56, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;JUs shall discard a message with BRT set to value 0 or 3 if the Range field is received as No Statement.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0029", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall manage its database to ensure it is not saturated by force tell and emergency alerts if it has limited track capacity.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If system has limited track capacity&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 10, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;A system with a limited track capacity (e.g., F-15) should manage its database to insure that it shall not be saturated by force tell and emergency alerts.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0030", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall allow Force Tell and Emergency Indicators to override all operator controllable data filters.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When indicators are set&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 10, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;These indicators, when set, allow these messages to override all operator controllable data filters.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0031", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall distinguish between live tracks involved in an exercise and other live tracks using the Exercise Indicator.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 4, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;There is a requirement to distinguish between live tracks that are involved in an exercise and other live tracks being reported. This is accomplished by setting the Exercise Indicator in the J3 track messages.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0032", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall identify a track with Exercise Indicator 1 and Identity Amplifying Descriptor 6 (FAKER) as a friendly track acting as a hostile for exercise purposes.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When Exercise Indicator=1 and IAD=6&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;In particular, a track with the Exercise Indicator set to value 1, Exercise Track, and the Identity Amplifying Descriptor set to value 6, FAKER, shall be identified as a friendly track acting as a hostile for exercise purposes.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0033", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall identify a track with Exercise Indicator 1 and Identity Amplifying Descriptor 5 (JOKER) as a friendly track acting as a suspect for exercise purposes.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When Exercise Indicator=1 and IAD=5&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Also, a track with the Exercise Indicator set to value 1, Exercise Track, and the Identity Amplifying Descriptor set to value 5, JOKER, shall be identified as a friendly track acting as a suspect for exercise purposes.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0034", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not associate simulated tracks with live tracks.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 9, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Simulated tracks will not be correlated with live tracks.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0035", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall treat all data associated with a track as simulated if the Simulation Indicator is set in a J2 or J3 message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When Simulation Indicator is set&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 9, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When the Simulation Indicator is set in a J2 or J3 message, all data associated with that track are simulated and should not be associated with a live track.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0036", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall display simulated and live tracks simultaneously such that they are readily distinguishable from each other if both are displayed.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If displaying both simulated and live tracks&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 10, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If a system displays both simulated and live tracks simultaneously, the tracks should be readily distinguishable from each other.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0037", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept the alert in its database when receiving a J2.0 message with EMG IND or FT IND set for a PU/RU.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J2.0 with alert indicators&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 102, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall accept the alert in their databases.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0038", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall clear the alert in its database upon receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 3 or 4) message clearing the alert indicator for a PU/RU.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.0 ACT=3 or 4&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 102, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall clear the alert in their databases upon receipt of the J7.0 (ACT = 3 or 4).&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0039", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept the emergency alert in its database when receiving a J2 message with EMG IND set from a JU on itself.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J2 with EMG IND&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 102, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving C2 JUs shall accept the alert in their \\ndatabases.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0040", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall clear the emergency alert in its database upon receipt of a J2 message with EMG IND set to 0.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J2 with EMG IND=0&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 102, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall clear the alert in their databases, if set, upon receipt of a J2 message with the EMG IND set to value 0.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0041", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall set/clear the alert indicator in its database upon receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 4) message changing force tell status on another JU.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.0 ACT=4 for another JU&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 102, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The other JUs shall set/clear the alert indicator in their databases upon receipt of the J7.0 (ACT = 4) message.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0042", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept the force tell alert when receiving a J3.0 message with FT IND set for a reference point, line, or area.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J3.0 with FT IND&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 103, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall accept the alert.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0043", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall terminate the force tell alert upon receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 4) message for a reference point, line, or area.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.0 ACT=4&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 103, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall terminate the alert upon receipt of the J7.0 (ACT = 4) message.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0044", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept the emergency or force tell alert in its database when receiving a J3.2, J3.3, J3.4, or J3.5 message with the indicator set for a track.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J3.x with alert indicator&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 104, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall accept the alert in their databases.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0045", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall set/clear the appropriate EMG IND or FT IND in its database upon receipt of a J7.0 (ACT = 3 or 4) message for a track when it does not have R2.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.0 ACT=3 or 4 and no R2&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 105, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Other receiving JUs without R2 shall set/clear the appropriate EMG IND or FT IND in their databases upon receipt of the J7.0 (ACT = 3 or 4) message.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0046", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept the alert when receiving a J3.5 (PTI=0) or J5.4 message with EMG IND or FT IND set for a land point or subsurface contact.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J3.5/J5.4 with alert&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 105, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall accept the alert.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0047", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept the alert in its database when receiving a J3.7 message with EMG IND or FT IND set for EW Product information.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J3.7 with alert&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 106, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All receiving JUs shall accept the alert in their databases.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0048", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept Strength changes when received in a J7.0 (ACT = 5) message or indicate to the operator that a Strength change has been received.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.0 ACT=5&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 106, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All JUs shall accept Strength changes when received or indicate to the operator that a Strength change has been received.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0049", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept Vehicle Strength changes when received in a J7.0 (ACT = 5) message or indicate to the operator that a Vehicle Strength change has been received, if it implements the J3.5C3 word.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If implementing J3.5C3 and receiving J7.0 ACT=5&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 106, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All JUs that implement the J3.5C3 word shall accept Vehicle Strength changes when received or indicate to the operator that a Vehicle Strength change has been received.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0050", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall process the Strength, Total Number of Vehicles and Strength, Percent of Tracked Vehicles fields in the J7.0E0 when the J7.0 (ACT = 5) message is implemented for reception and Strength fields are implemented.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If implementing J7.0 ACT=5 reception and Strength fields&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 107, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When the J7.0 (ACT = 5) message is implemented for reception, and the Strength field in the J7.0I word and the J3.5C3 word are implemented, both the Strength, Total Number of Vehicles and the Strength, Percent of Tracked Vehicles fields in the J7.0E0 must be processed.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0051", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall automatically accept the remote ID for database update when receiving a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message from the controlling unit (Controlling Unit Indicator = 1).&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.0 ACT=1 from controlling unit&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All interface units receiving a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message from the controlling unit (Controlling Unit Indicator field set to value 1) shall automatically accept the remote data for database update.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0052", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall resolve ID differences reported in a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message with Controlling Unit Indicator = 0 in accordance with Table 4.7-2.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.0 ACT=1 with CUI=0&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The ID received in the J7.0 (ACT = 1) message, with the Controlling Unit Indicator field set to value 0, shall be processed in accordance with Table 4.7-2.&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 97, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;TABLE 4.7-2.  Identity Difference Resolution&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0053", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall inhibit transmission of the J7.0 (ACT = 1) message until the surveillance message is received with Identity Difference Indicator reset to 0, if a conflict is indicated and Identity Difference Indicator was 1 in the surveillance message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If ID Diff Ind = 1 and conflict exists&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 96, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Follow the actions in Table 4.7-2, but where a \\nconflict is indicated the unit shall inhibit transmission of the J7.0 (ACT = \\n1) until the surveillance message is received with the Identity Difference \\nIndicator set to value 0&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0054", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU may take no action with respect to the reported ID if the Identity Difference Indicator is set to 1 in the surveillance message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If ID Diff Ind = 1&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Take no action with respect to the reported ID; an operator alert may be provided as a system option.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0055", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall alert the operator for manual resolution when an Exercise Indicator conflict exists.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When Exercise Indicator conflict detected&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 91, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;a conflict exists and the operator shall be alerted for manual resolution.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0056", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall process Environment/Category conflicts prior to ID conflicts.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When both conflicts exist&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 90, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;the Environment/Category conflict shall be processed and resolved prior to the resolution of the ID conflict.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0057", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall alert the operator if the locally held Environment/Category differs from the received Environment/Category in a J3.X or J7.0 (ACT=1) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When E/C mismatch detected&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 92, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the locally held Environment/Category of a track is different from the Environment/Category received in a J3.X or a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message for that track, the operator shall be alerted&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0058", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall alert the operator if local data and received data differ as to whether the TN is assigned to a point or to a track.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When Point/Track assignment mismatch detected&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 92, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the local data and the received data differ as to whether the TN is assigned to a point or to a track, the operator shall be alerted.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0059", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept the received data for retransmission when receiving a J7.0 (ACT = 2) Change Data Order message, except as indicated by specific rules (e.g. controlling unit rejection).&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.0 ACT=2&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 99, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The received data, if implemented, must be accepted for retransmission except as indicated in rule e below.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0060", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not transmit or accept any data on the track which differs from the data received in the J7.0 (ACT = 2) message until a 30-second lock-out has elapsed, after accepting the message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;After accepting J7.0 ACT=2&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 99, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;once the J7.0 (ACT = 2) message has been received and accepted, a JU shall not transmit or accept any data on the track which differs from the data received in the J7.0 (ACT = 2) message until a 30-second lock-out has elapsed.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0061", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept different data prior to the completion of the 30-second lockout period if the different data is from the same source that originated the previous J7.0 (ACT = 2) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;During lockout, if data from same source&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 99, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;After reception of the J7.0 (ACT = 2) message, JUs shall accept different data prior to the completion of the 30-second lockout period provided the different data from the same source that originated the previous J7.0 (ACT =2) message.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0062", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not accept a J7.0 (ACT = 2) Change Data Order message containing an ID of Pending.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.0 ACT=2 with ID=Pending&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 99, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Units receiving a J7.0 (ACT = 2) Change Data Order message containing an ID of Pending shall not accept that order.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0063", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall cease reporting the track and transmit a J7.0 (ACT = 0) message if it has R2 on the track and does not implement the changed Environment/Category received in a J7.0 (ACT = 2) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &quot;If has R2 and doesn&#x27;t implement new E/C from J7.0 ACT=2&quot;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 99, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Receiving JUs which do not implement the changed \\nEnvironment/Category and have R2 on the track must cease reporting the track \\nand transmit a J7.0 (ACT = 0) message.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0064", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall respond to a J7.1 (ACT = 1) Data Update Request by transmitting all J3.7 EW data on the TN if the Addressee TN is 00177 and it has R2.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If receiving J7.1 ACT=1 with Addressee=00177 and has R2&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 86, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the J7.1 Addressee TN is set to value 00177, JUs with R2 transmit \\nall J3.7 EW data on the TN&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0065", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall respond to a J7.1 (ACT = 1) Data Update Request addressed to own JU by transmitting all J3.7 EW data on the TN with Response Indicator set to 1.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If receiving J7.1 ACT=1 addressed to self&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 86, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the J7.1 Addressee TN is set to own JU, transmit all J3.7 EW data on the TN ... with the J3.7 Response Indicator set to value 1.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0066", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall process targets reported in J12.7 messages as EW Product information for the purposes of environment/category filtering.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When filtering&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Targets reported in J12.7 messages shall be processed as EW Product information for the purposes of environment/category filtering.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0067", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not filter Active nonsimulated C2 IUs.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When filtering&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Active nonsimulated C2 IUs cannot be filtered.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0068", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not inhibit the J7.2 Correlation message by any filter.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When filtering&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.2 Correlation message shall not be inhibited by any filter.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0069", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall accept all zero or nonzero special code values as received if implementing the special codes capability.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If implementing special codes&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 124, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;JUs implementing the special code capability shall accept all zero or nonzero special code values as received.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0070", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall provide nonambiguous displays for both IFF/SIF code responses and special code responses if implementing the special codes capability.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;If implementing special codes&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 124, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;JUs implementing the special codes capability shall provide nonambiguous displays for both IFF/SIF code responses and the special code responses.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0071", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall automatically set the designated mode(s) for the specified track to the No Data status upon receipt of a J7.5 (ACT = 0) message, except for Mode IV which may be automatic or operator determined.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.5 ACT=0&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 120, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All JUs, upon receipt of the J7.5 (ACT = 0) message, shall automatically set the designated mode(s) for the specified track to the No Data status (except that acceptance or rejection of a received J7.5 (ACT=0) Mode IV Clear message may be automatic or by operator determination).&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0072", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall indicate on the operator display that a J7.5 (ACT = 0) message was received.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.5 ACT=0&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 120, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The operator display shall indicate that a J7.5 (ACT = 0) message was received.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0073", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall respond to a J7.5 (ACT = 2) IFF/SIF Update Request from the R2 unit by initiating a J7.5 (ACT = 1) message if valid local data are held for the requested mode(s).&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.5 ACT=2 from R2 unit and holding valid data&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 123, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;NonR2 units receiving the J7.5 (ACT = 2) message from the R2 unit \\nwill respond by initiating a J7.5 (ACT = 1) message if valid local data \\n(nonzero codes) are held for the requested mode(s).&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0074", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall not respond to a J7.5 (ACT = 2) IFF/SIF Update Request from other nonR2 units.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.5 ACT=2 from nonR2&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 123, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;NonR2 units receiving the J7.5 (ACT = 2) message from other nonR2 units will not respond to the request.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0075", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall purge received J7.7 Association data if data have not been updated after a specified time.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;Optionally&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 138, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.7 message is transmitted periodically and JUs should purge received data if data have not been updated after a specified time.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0076", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall drop remote filters when a J7.6 (ACT = 2) message is received.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.6 ACT=2&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Remote filters shall be dropped when a J7.6 (ACT = 2) message is received.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0077", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall have the capability to drop remote filter reports from its own system.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;each JU should have the capability to drop remote filter reports from its own system.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-07-R0078", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The Non-C2 JU shall supersede previously received Link 11/11B, NATO Link 1 TN, ATDL-1 TN, or IJMS SRN data with the latest received data on a track.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;When receiving J7.4&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 118, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The latest Link 11/11B, NATO Link 1 TN, ATDL-1 TN, or IJMS SRN received on a track shall supersede previously received data.&#x27;}]}</pre>"}], "repeat": false, "min_rows": 0}], "blockers": [], "requirement_meta": [{"id": "S16-07-R0001", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0002", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0003", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0004", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0005", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0006", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0007", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0008", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0009", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0010", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0011", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0012", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0013", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0014", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0015", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0016", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0017", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0018", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0019", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0020", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0021", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0022", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0023", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0024", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0025", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0026", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0027", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0028", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0029", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0030", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0031", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0032", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0033", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0034", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0035", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0036", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0037", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0038", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0039", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0040", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0041", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0042", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0043", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0044", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0045", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0046", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0047", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0048", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0049", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0050", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0051", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0052", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0053", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0054", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0055", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0056", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0057", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0058", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0059", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0060", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0061", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0062", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0063", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0064", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0065", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0066", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0067", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0068", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0069", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0070", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0071", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0072", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0073", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0074", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0075", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0076", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0077", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-07-R0078", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}], "no_content": false, "material_sha256": "312e6178deb34023ee38743247670c8637156c30649a03e37b16f66bc20ffa5d"};
